# Hero widgets — live Discord presence via the Lanyard API (no backend):
#   * "Now Playing"  (bottom-left)  — your Spotify status
#   * "Watching on YouTube" (bottom-right) — a "Watching YouTube" Rich Presence
#     (e.g. the PreMiD browser extension with the YouTube presence enabled)
#
# Setup:
#   1. Join the Lanyard Discord:  https://discord.gg/lanyard
#   2. Discord -> Settings -> Connections -> connect Spotify
#      (for YouTube: install PreMiD + its YouTube presence, keep Discord running)
#   3. Discord -> Settings -> Advanced -> enable Developer Mode,
#      then right-click your username -> Copy User ID
#   4. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the id below, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Leave blank and both widgets just show an "Offline" placeholder (layout unaffected).
VITE_LANYARD_ID=1489321223497191425
